    "updated_at": "2020-06-02T20:33:23Z",
    "body": "> \"gattserverdisconnected\" is the only error you need to consider after the Promise returned by startNotifications() resolves.\r\n\r\nIf the service my characteristic is associated with is removed then my event listener needs to be cleaned up as it is no longer listening to a valid characteristic (I'm assuming). It seems like at the very least I need to listen to both 'serviceremoved' and 'gattserverdisconnected' correct?",
